// Two value bindings of one variable. In Flora-2 the second is a
// unification, a condition that the two values are equal; the slice reads
// a binding as its variable's one definition and has no reading for that.
Vogel[|hoogte => numeriek(niet_negatief, geheel)|].
Vogel[|lengte => numeriek(niet_negatief, geheel)|].
@!{'hoogte van een vogel'}
?V[hoogte -> ?X] :- ?V : Vogel, ?X = 10, ?X = ?V.lengte.
